  "description": "White aircraft with the Eurowings 'wing' sweeping over the tail: a cyan band across the fin tip, a white gap and a thin gray line, then a big burgundy and magenta sweep from the middle of the fin down across the aft fuselage to the belly, with a cyan swoosh on the fuselage running up into the fin's leading edge. 'Eurowings' in burgundy over the forward windows, the small wing symbol below the cockpit.",
