      "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:D-AEWS_(aircraft)",
      "accessed": "2026-11-13",
      "note": "A320 D-AEWS, left side, 2025-10-17 (Andre Gerwing): the scheme's main photo. Re-checked 2026-11-15: fitted to the measured A320 shape (doors pinned, level), the title measured on it and the tail's areas overlaid (within about 0.2 m)."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Eurowings_Logo.svg",
      "title": "Eurowings Logo.svg (2015 logo)",
      "accessed": "2026-11-13",
      "note": "The tail's colors repeat the 2015 logo's: burgundy, magenta, two cyans and gray; hex values read from the SVG, not published as paint."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:D-AENI_(aircraft)",
      "accessed": "2026-11-13",
      "note": "A320neo D-AENI from the right, 2025-04/06: the same design mirrored (sweeps forward on the right too)."
