  "notes": "Left side drawn from D-AEWS (A320, 2025-10-17, Düsseldorf); right side seen on D-AENI and D-AENH. A320neos also carry a temporary 'A320neo – less noise, less fuel, less CO2' sticker under the title (not drawn). The registration is preceded by small EU and German flags. The belly isn't seen in the photos used: left white. A June 2026 brand refresh (new logo and typeface) hasn't reached the paint on aircraft photographed through September 2026. Re-checked 2026-11-15 on D-AEWS fitted to the A320 shape: the title's baseline is just above the windows (y 0.34; it had been drawn across them), cap 0.35, running x 0.158-0.321; lowercase 0.68 of the E; the swooshes drawn as curves.",
  "history": "Replaces Skyarium v1's approximation (a purple fin with a magenta band). The 2015 scheme replaced Germanwings' and the old Eurowings' liveries."
